<title>SOUTH AFRICA: CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-WESTERN PROVINCE V AUSTRALIA SCOREBOARD.</headline>
<dateline>CAPE TOWN 1997-02-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Scoreboard on the first day of</p>
<p>the three-day match between Western Province and Australia at</p>
<p>Newlands on Saturday.</p>
<p>Australia first innings M.Hayden c Ackerman b Schultz</p>
<p>112 M.Taylor c Solomons b Pringle 85 M.Elliott c Koenig b</p>
<p>Kallis 74 S.Waugh c Koenig b Pringle 69 G.Blewett not out 48</p>
<p>J.Langer not out 31 Extras (lb-7 w-1 nb-12) 20 Total (for four</p>
<p>wickets) 439</p>
<p>Fall of wickets: 1-194 2-220 3-335 4-361</p>
<p>To bat: Michael Bevan, Ian Healy, Andrew Bichel, Paul</p>
<p>Reiffel, Jason Gillespie.</p>
<p>Bowling: Schultz 22-2-96-1 (4nb), Pringle 24-3-81-2 (8nb),</p>
<p>Matthews 21-1-86-0, Kallis 22-1-108-1 (1w), McMillan 4-0-17-0,</p>
<p>Kirsten 9-0-41-0, Ackerman 2-0-3-0</p>
